  1	# Taskboard CLI
  2	
  3	A dependency-free TypeScript task manager for [Bun](https://bun.sh/). Tasks are stored in `TASKBOARD_FILE`, or in `.taskboard.json` in the current directory when that variable is unset.
  4	
  5	```sh
  6	bun run src/cli.ts add --title "Write release notes" --tags work,docs --due 2026-09-10
  7	bun run src/cli.ts list --status open --tag docs
  8	bun run src/cli.ts list --overdue 2026-09-11
  9	bun run src/cli.ts done 1
 10	bun run src/cli.ts delete 1
 11	bun run src/cli.ts stats
 12	```
 13	
 14	Every invocation writes exactly one JSON value to stdout. Failures also write a short diagnostic to stderr and exit non-zero. Tags are trimmed, lowercased, and deduplicated. Dates use the exact `YYYY-MM-DD` format.
 15	
 16	The data file is replaced atomically after successful mutations. IDs increase monotonically and are not reused after deletion. Run the self-tests with:
 17	
 18	```sh
 19	bun test
 20	```
